{"4447380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Berliner", "steam_appid": 4447380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Wilson a rookie baker who just opened a new bakery in west Berlin. Build up your dream business or spend all of your time at the bar! Explore the walled city, deliver people pastries and don’t forget customer isn’t always right!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bake!</strong> or<strong> Make Coffee!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Youre running a bakery cafe at the end of the day. You have customers you need to satisfy even though some might be difficult.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/77140da5f1db21f98c494c8d5d82e2a5.poster.avif?t=1788189725\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/77140da5f1db21f98c494c8d5d82e2a5.webm?t=1788189725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/77140da5f1db21f98c494c8d5d82e2a5.mp4?t=1788189725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose from tons of pastries!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each have their own unique baking process. You can make anyhting you want in any order you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/6308978831b233a20d42f919918adcbb.poster.avif?t=1788189725\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/6308978831b233a20d42f919918adcbb.webm?t=1788189725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/6308978831b233a20d42f919918adcbb.mp4?t=1788189725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate random events that take place in Berlin. Don't let your guard down.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Berlin after all, people are crazy here... Be careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/d5fcf727d8f13e7abb653c02a406b922.poster.avif?t=1788189725\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/d5fcf727d8f13e7abb653c02a406b922.webm?t=1788189725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/d5fcf727d8f13e7abb653c02a406b922.mp4?t=1788189725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Wilson a rookie baker who just opened a new bakery in west Berlin. Build up your dream business or spend all of your time at the bar! Explore the walled city, deliver people pastries and don’t forget customer isn’t always right!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bake!</strong> or<strong> Make Coffee!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Youre running a bakery cafe at the end of the day. You have customers you need to satisfy even though some might be difficult.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/77140da5f1db21f98c494c8d5d82e2a5.poster.avif?t=1788189725\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/77140da5f1db21f98c494c8d5d82e2a5.webm?t=1788189725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/77140da5f1db21f98c494c8d5d82e2a5.mp4?t=1788189725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose from tons of pastries!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each have their own unique baking process. You can make anyhting you want in any order you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/6308978831b233a20d42f919918adcbb.poster.avif?t=1788189725\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/6308978831b233a20d42f919918adcbb.webm?t=1788189725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/6308978831b233a20d42f919918adcbb.mp4?t=1788189725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate random events that take place in Berlin. Don't let your guard down.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Berlin after all, people are crazy here... Be careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/d5fcf727d8f13e7abb653c02a406b922.poster.avif?t=1788189725\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/d5fcf727d8f13e7abb653c02a406b922.webm?t=1788189725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/extras/d5fcf727d8f13e7abb653c02a406b922.mp4?t=1788189725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The Berliner is your quintessential bakery and cafe simulator set in 1980s west Berlin. You can explore the walled city, bake pastries, brew coffee, serve and deal with customers. Grow your business or spend it all at the bar its up to you. And don’t forget this is Berlin! Don't let your guard down.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/c7ef6ed80a4f2d5b71acb5bbc41ea686ad0634da/header.jpg?t=1788189725", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/3c32f31cd94b377345e90121eecebeade63debec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788189725", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/3c32f31cd94b377345e90121eecebeade63debec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788189725", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Kelt Games"], "publishers": ["Kelt Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447380/cf2ae8cd3d980bbb922af17d371bd43e6ab249b3/ss_cf2ae8cd3d980bbb922af17d371bd43e6ab249b3.600x338.jpg?t=1788189725", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam